    <string name="doc_modules_1">Modules are plain .py files that you place in a folder and import via the \"Load modules\" button on the home screen.</string>
    <string name="doc_modules_2">Each module must define at least NAME and COMMANDS at the top level. AUTHOR and DESCRIPTION are optional but recommended.</string>
    <string name="doc_modules_3">After saving the file to your scripts folder, tap \"Reload modules\" on the home screen (the accessibility service must be running).</string>
